# M4-E one-shot CI campaign trigger

This file exists only to trigger the first automated M4-E campaign when it is
introduced on `main`.

The `M4 Live Campaign` workflow listens for a push to `main` that changes
this exact path. Ordinary future pushes do not start another campaign.

The triggered run performs:

1. an eight-minute Live-1 smoke segment;
2. only if smoke succeeds, the full 72-hour segmented M4-E campaign;
3. final evidence analysis and publication validation.

Do not modify this file merely to rerun the campaign. Use the workflow's manual
`workflow_dispatch` input instead.
